      "writtenOn": "2026-05-31T19:25:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of this loop we could just check:\n\n```\n\tif (offset \u003e\u003d counter \u0026\u0026 offset \u003c counter + num_cntr * stride \u0026\u0026\n\t    (offset - counter) % stride \u003d\u003d 0) {\n\t\tinfo-\u003etype \u003d PKVM_IOMMU_PMU_REG_COUNTER;\n\t\tinfo-\u003ecounter \u003d (offset - counter) / stride;\n\t\tiommu_pmu_counter_caps(iommu, perfcap, cfg, info-\u003ecounter, info);\n\t\treturn true;\n\t}\n```\n\n?",
